  "description": "meme-id: behind_every_screaming_goat; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The image features a close-up of a goat with the text 'behind every screaming goat is a muslim with his pants down.' This meme uses a visual of an animal to symbolize a human group (Muslims) in a derogatory and stereotypical manner. The text implies that Muslims are inherently associated with inappropriate or shameful behavior (screaming, pants down), which is a harmful and hateful stereotype. This aligns with the 'Islamophobia' category in the provided knowledge base, as it maps the image of a goat (a common animal associated with rural or 'backward' imagery) onto Muslims, suggesting they are primitive, undignified, or prone to scandalous behavior. The intent is to demean and dehumanize Muslims through a crude, offensive analogy, making it a hateful meme targeting a specific religious group.",
